        "type": "text",
        "text": "Classic presentation: anorexia & periumbilical or epigastric pain followed by RLQ pain (12-18hrs), N/V (vomiting usually occurs after the pain)"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
       "indLeft": 0,
       "indRight": 0,
       "indFirst": 0,
