       "borders": null,
       "marker": null
      },
      "content": [
       {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "Appendiceal inflammation stimulates nerve fibers around T8-T10, causing vague periumbilical pain – once the peritoneum becomes irritated, it radiates to the RLQ"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "type": "paragraph",
